Error [E0108]: Argument 1 to `.index_of()` should be String (text), not Int (a whole number)
  --> list_index_of_arg_type.jet:4:26
    |
  4 |     print(names.index_of(1) ?? -1)
    |                          ^
 Why: Built-in methods need arguments of the right type
 Fix: Put the value in text with interpolation: "{x}"
